+    $$ \text{final\_color} = T \cdot \text{background\_color} + \text{render\_color} $$
+    [S1, unofficial]. If the accumulated opacity $1 - T$ is below a threshold (e.g., 0.001), discard the fragment [S2, unofficial].
 
